#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1
msgid "UniSDK Build System Architecture Documentation"
msgstr "UniSDK 构建系统架构文档"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:3
msgid "1. Overall Architecture Overview"
msgstr "1. 总体架构概述"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:5
msgid ""
"The UniSDK build system adopts a modular, extensible architecture design "
"that integrates multiple tools such as Make, CMake, Ninja, West, and "
"Kconfig to form a complete compilation and build workflow. The system "
"supports multiple compilation methods, including West commands, direct "
"CMake calls, and Make commands, providing developers with flexible build "
"options."
msgstr "UniSDK 构建系统采用模块化、可扩展的架构设计，集成了 Make、CMake、Ninja、West 和 Kconfig 等多种工具，形成了完整的编译构建工作流。系统支持多种编译方式，包括 West 命令、直接 CMake 调用和 Make 命令，为开发者提供灵活的构建选项。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:7
msgid "1.1 Core Components"
msgstr "1.1 核心组件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:9
msgid ""
"**CMake**: The main build system responsible for project configuration, "
"dependency management, and build process definition"
msgstr "**CMake**：主构建系统，负责项目配置、依赖管理和构建流程定义"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"**Ninja**: A high-performance build tool that executes actual compilation"
" tasks as CMake's backend"
msgstr "**Ninja**：高性能构建工具，作为 CMake 的后端执行实际的编译任务"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:11
msgid ""
"**West**: Zephyr project management tool extended in UniSDK to manage "
"project and simplify build workflows"
msgstr "**West**：Zephyr 项目管理工具，在 UniSDK 中扩展用于管理项目和简化构建工作流"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:12
msgid ""
"**Kconfig**: Configuration management system for handling compile-time "
"configuration options"
msgstr "**Kconfig**：配置管理系统，用于处理编译时配置选项"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:13
msgid ""
"**Make**: Provides a traditional make command interface as a frontend to "
"CMake"
msgstr "**Make**：提供传统的 make 命令接口，作为 CMake 的前端"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:15
msgid "1.2 Directory Structure"
msgstr "1.2 目录结构"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:17
msgid ""
"Build system-related files are mainly distributed in the following "
"directories:"
msgstr "构建系统相关文件主要分布在以下目录："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md
msgid "SDK Directory Structure (Build System)"
msgstr "SDK 目录结构（构建系统）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:51
msgid "1.3 Build System"
msgstr "1.3 构建系统"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:53
msgid ""
"The UniSDK build system is a comprehensive framework that combines "
"multiple tools to provide a seamless development experience. The "
"following diagram illustrates the overall architecture and toolchain "
"relationships:"
msgstr "UniSDK 构建系统是一个综合框架，结合了多种工具以提供无缝的开发体验。下图说明了整体架构和工具链关系："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:55
msgid "![Build System Architecture](pics/image.png)"
msgstr "![构建系统架构](pics/image.png)"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:55
msgid "Build System Architecture"
msgstr "构建系统架构"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:57
msgid "The build system is designed around the following key components:"
msgstr "构建系统围绕以下关键组件设计："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:59
msgid ""
"**West**: The command-line interface for developers, providing a unified "
"entry point for various build operations"
msgstr "**West**：面向开发者的命令行接口，为各种构建操作提供统一入口"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:60
msgid "**Make**: Handles high-level build orchestration and pre-build checks"
msgstr "**Make**：处理高级构建编排和预构建检查"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:61
msgid ""
"**CMake**: Core build system responsible for project configuration, "
"dependency management, and build rule generation"
msgstr "**CMake**：核心构建系统，负责项目配置、依赖管理和构建规则生成"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:62
msgid ""
"**Kconfig**: Configuration management system for handling compile-time "
"options"
msgstr "**Kconfig**：配置管理系统，用于处理编译时选项"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:63
msgid ""
"**YAML**: Configuration format used for various system configurations, "
"including pin multiplexing"
msgstr "**YAML**：用于各种系统配置（包括引脚复用）的配置格式"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:65
msgid ""
"This architecture enables a flexible and modular build process, allowing "
"developers to easily configure, build, and manage their projects while "
"maintaining consistency across different target platforms."
msgstr "该架构实现了灵活且模块化的构建过程，使开发者能够轻松配置、构建和管理项目，同时在不同目标平台之间保持一致性。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:68
msgid "2. CMake Build System"
msgstr "2. CMake 构建系统"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:70
msgid "2.1 CMake Core Process"
msgstr "2.1 CMake 核心流程"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:72
msgid ""
"The CMake build system is the core of the UniSDK compilation process, "
"responsible for project configuration, dependency resolution, and build "
"rule generation."
msgstr "CMake 构建系统是 UniSDK 编译过程的核心，负责项目配置、依赖解析和构建规则生成。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:74
msgid "2.1.1 Initialization Phase"
msgstr "2.1.1 初始化阶段"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:76
msgid "**Entry Point**: The build system supports **two entry point modes**:"
msgstr "**入口**：构建系统支持**两种入口模式**："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:77
msgid ""
"**Root Directory Entry**: Uses the root directory's `CMakeLists.txt` as "
"the entry point to build the entire SDK"
msgstr "**根目录入口**：使用根目录的 `CMakeLists.txt` 作为入口来构建整个 SDK"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:78
msgid ""
"**Application Entry**: Uses an application-level `CMakeLists.txt` "
"(typically located in the `samples/` directory) as the entry point to "
"build a specific application"
msgstr "**应用入口**：使用应用级 `CMakeLists.txt`（通常位于 `samples/` 目录中）作为入口来构建特定应用"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:79
msgid "**Version Requirements**: Sets the minimum CMake version (3.20.0)"
msgstr "**版本要求**：设置最低 CMake 版本（3.20.0）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:80
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**SDK Integration**: Locates and loads the Telink package configuration "
"through `find_package(Telink REQUIRED HINTS $ENV{TELINK_BASE})`"
msgstr "**SDK 集成**：通过 `find_package(Telink REQUIRED HINTS $ENV{TELINK_BASE})` 定位并加载 Telink 包配置"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:81
msgid ""
"**Project Setup**: Configures project-specific settings, including "
"project name, supported languages, and target creation"
msgstr "**项目设置**：配置项目特定设置，包括项目名称、支持的语言和目标创建"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:83
msgid ""
"**Key Include Guards:** The build system uses two important include "
"guards to manage inclusion and prevent redundant processing:"
msgstr "**关键包含保护**：构建系统使用两个重要的包含保护来管理包含并防止冗余处理："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:86
msgid "**TELINK_ROOT_INCLUDED**:"
msgstr "**TELINK_ROOT_INCLUDED**："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:87
msgid "Set to `TRUE` in the root directory's `CMakeLists.txt`"
msgstr "在根目录的 `CMakeLists.txt` 中设置为 `TRUE`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:88
msgid ""
"Used by `telink_default.cmake` to determine if the root directory has "
"already been included"
msgstr "由 `telink_default.cmake` 用于判断根目录是否已经被包含"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:89
msgid ""
"If not defined, `telink_default.cmake` will include the root directory's "
"`CMakeLists.txt`"
msgstr "如果未定义，`telink_default.cmake` 将包含根目录的 `CMakeLists.txt`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:90
msgid ""
"It will be removed in future versions when the application-level "
"CMakeLists.txt is supported as the entry point."
msgstr "在未来的版本中，当应用级 CMakeLists.txt 作为入口得到支持时，此机制将被移除。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:92
msgid "**TELINK_PACKAGE_INCLUDED**:"
msgstr "**TELINK_PACKAGE_INCLUDED**："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:93
msgid "Set to `TRUE` in `TelinkConfig.cmake` when the Telink package is loaded"
msgstr "在加载 Telink 包时，在 `TelinkConfig.cmake` 中设置为 `TRUE`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:94
msgid "Prevents multiple loading of the Telink package configuration"
msgstr "防止多次加载 Telink 包配置"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:95
msgid ""
"Checked in the root directory's `CMakeLists.txt` to avoid redundant "
"package loading"
msgstr "在根目录的 `CMakeLists.txt` 中进行检查，以避免冗余的包加载"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:97
msgid "**Entry Point Modes Comparison:**"
msgstr "**入口模式对比：**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Entry Point"
msgstr "入口"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "**Root Directory Entry**"
msgstr "**根目录入口**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "`CMakeLists.txt` (root)"
msgstr "`CMakeLists.txt`（根目录）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "`cmake -B build -G Ninja .`"
msgstr "`cmake -B build -G Ninja .`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Builds the entire SDK as a library"
msgstr "将整个 SDK 构建为库"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "**Application Entry**"
msgstr "**应用入口**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "`CMakeLists.txt` (samples/<AppName>)"
msgstr "`CMakeLists.txt`（samples/<AppName>）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "`cmake -B build -G Ninja samples/gpio_demo`"
msgstr "`cmake -B build -G Ninja samples/gpio_demo`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:19
msgid "Builds a specific application executable"
msgstr "构建特定应用的可执行文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:104
msgid ""
"**Application-Level Entry Point Implementation:** All applications in the"
" `samples/` directory must provide their own `CMakeLists.txt` file, which"
" serves as the entry point for the build process when building a specific"
" application. This file should:"
msgstr "**应用级入口实现：** `samples/` 目录中的所有应用都必须提供自己的 `CMakeLists.txt` 文件，该文件在构建特定应用时作为构建过程的入口。此文件应："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:107
msgid "Set the minimum CMake version"
msgstr "设置最低 CMake 版本"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:108
msgid "Define the project name and default language (C)"
msgstr "定义项目名称和默认语言（C）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:109
msgid "Add C sources using wildcards"
msgstr "使用通配符添加 C 源文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:110
msgid "Create an executable target"
msgstr "创建可执行目标"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:111
msgid "Conditionally add C++ support if CONFIG_TLK_ALLOW_CPP_WRAPPERS is enabled"
msgstr "如果启用了 CONFIG_TLK_ALLOW_CPP_WRAPPERS，则条件性地添加 C++ 支持"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:113
msgid ""
"The application-level CMakeLists.txt is automatically processed by the "
"build system (via Make or West commands), which handles the integration "
"with the core SDK components."
msgstr "应用级 CMakeLists.txt 由构建系统（通过 Make 或 West 命令）自动处理，该系统负责处理与核心 SDK 组件的集成。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:115
msgid "2.1.2 Module Loading Phase"
msgstr "2.1.2 模块加载阶段"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:117
msgid ""
"`telink_default.cmake` loads all necessary CMake modules in a specific "
"order:"
msgstr "`telink_default.cmake` 按特定顺序加载所有必要的 CMake 模块："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:129
msgid ""
"Each module is responsible for the configuration and implementation of "
"specific functionality, together forming a complete build system."
msgstr "每个模块负责特定功能的配置和实现，共同构成完整的构建系统。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:131
msgid "2.2 Core CMake Modules"
msgstr "2.2 核心 CMake 模块"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:133
msgid "2.2.1 python.cmake"
msgstr "2.2.1 python.cmake"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:135
#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:311
msgid "This module is from the Zephyr project."
msgstr "此模块来自 Zephyr 项目。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:137
msgid ""
"The `python.cmake` module is responsible for configuring and validating "
"the Python environment required by the UniSDK build system. As the first "
"module loaded in the build process, it ensures that all Python-dependent "
"components have a consistent and compatible Python environment."
msgstr "`python.cmake` 模块负责配置和验证 UniSDK 构建系统所需的 Python 环境。作为构建过程中加载的第一个模块，它确保所有依赖 Python 的组件都拥有一致且兼容的 Python 环境。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:139
msgid "**Key Features and Functionality:**"
msgstr "**主要特性和功能：**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:141
msgid "**UTF-8 Encoding Configuration**"
msgstr "**UTF-8 编码配置**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:142
msgid "Sets `PYTHONIOENCODING` to \"utf-8\" on Windows systems"
msgstr "在 Windows 系统上将 `PYTHONIOENCODING` 设置为 \"utf-8\""

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:143
msgid ""
"Ensures consistent output encoding when Python scripts are executed by "
"CMake"
msgstr "确保 Python 脚本由 CMake 执行时输出编码一致"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:144
msgid ""
"Prevents encoding issues that could occur when Python isn't connected to "
"a terminal"
msgstr "防止 Python 未连接到终端时可能出现的编码问题"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:146
msgid "**Python Version Management**"
msgstr "**Python 版本管理**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:147
msgid "Defines a minimum required Python version (3.10)"
msgstr "定义所需的最低 Python 版本（3.10）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:148
msgid "Implements a robust Python executable discovery mechanism"
msgstr "实现了健壮的 Python 可执行文件发现机制"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:149
msgid "Prioritizes using the same Python interpreter as West when available"
msgstr "优先使用与 West 相同的 Python 解释器（如果可用）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:151
msgid "**Python Discovery Process**"
msgstr "**Python 发现流程**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:152
msgid "Checks for an existing `Python3_EXECUTABLE` variable first"
msgstr "首先检查现有的 `Python3_EXECUTABLE` 变量"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:153
msgid "Falls back to using `WEST_PYTHON` if available"
msgstr "回退到使用 `WEST_PYTHON`（如果可用）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:154
msgid ""
"Searches for \"python\" and \"python3\" executables in the system path "
"and virtual environments"
msgstr "在系统路径和虚拟环境中搜索 \"python\" 和 \"python3\" 可执行文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:155
msgid "Verifies discovered Python versions meet the minimum requirements"
msgstr "验证发现的 Python 版本满足最低要求"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:156
msgid "Rejects Python 2.x installations explicitly"
msgstr "明确拒绝 Python 2.x 安装"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:158
msgid "**Integration with CMake**"
msgstr "**与 CMake 的集成**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:159
msgid "Uses `find_package(Python3)` to finalize Python configuration"
msgstr "使用 `find_package(Python3)` 完成 Python 配置"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:160
msgid ""
"Sets the legacy `PYTHON_EXECUTABLE` variable for compatibility with "
"scripts expecting this variable"
msgstr "设置旧版 `PYTHON_EXECUTABLE` 变量，以兼容期望此变量的脚本"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:161
msgid "Uses `include_guard(GLOBAL)` to prevent multiple inclusions"
msgstr "使用 `include_guard(GLOBAL)` 防止多次包含"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:163
msgid ""
"This module ensures that all Python scripts used throughout the build "
"process (such as Kconfig processing, pinmux generation, and build "
"utilities) have access to a compatible Python interpreter, providing a "
"consistent build environment across different platforms."
msgstr "此模块确保整个构建过程中使用的所有 Python 脚本（如 Kconfig 处理、pinmux 生成和构建工具）都能访问兼容的 Python 解释器，在不同平台上提供一致的构建环境。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:165
msgid "2.2.2 compiler.cmake"
msgstr "2.2.2 compiler.cmake"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:167
msgid ""
"The `compiler.cmake` module is one of the core modules of the UniSDK "
"build system, responsible for configuring the compiler toolchain, "
"compiler options, and compilation flags. This module provides a complete "
"RISC-V compiler configuration and management mechanism."
msgstr "`compiler.cmake` 模块是 UniSDK 构建系统的核心模块之一，负责配置编译器工具链、编译选项和编译标志。此模块提供了完整的 RISC-V 编译器配置和管理机制。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:169
msgid "**Key features include:**"
msgstr "**主要特性包括：**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:171
msgid "**Compiler Environment Detection and Configuration**"
msgstr "**编译器环境检测和配置**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:172
msgid ""
"Automatically detects the TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH environment variable "
"setting"
msgstr "自动检测 TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH 环境变量设置"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:173
msgid "Supports cross-platform path handling"
msgstr "支持跨平台路径处理"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:174
msgid "Verifies the existence and validity of the RISC-V GCC compiler"
msgstr "验证 RISC-V GCC 编译器的存在和有效性"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:175
msgid ""
"Provides clear error messages and configuration guidance when the "
"compiler is not found"
msgstr "在未找到编译器时提供清晰的错误信息和配置指导"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:177
msgid "**Toolchain Component Setup**"
msgstr "**工具链组件设置**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:178
msgid "Configures primary compilation tools: C/C++ compiler, assembler"
msgstr "配置主要编译工具：C/C++ 编译器、汇编器"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:179
msgid "Sets up auxiliary tools: objdump, objcopy, etc."
msgstr "设置辅助工具：objdump、objcopy 等"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:180
msgid "Uniformly configures RISC-V target architecture and processor type"
msgstr "统一配置 RISC-V 目标架构和处理器类型"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:181
msgid "Sets the system name to Generic (for bare-metal development)"
msgstr "将系统名称设置为 Generic（用于裸机开发）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:183
msgid "**Compiler Options Application Function**"
msgstr "**编译选项应用函数**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:184
msgid ""
"Provides the `telink_apply_compiler_options()` function to apply "
"compilation options to targets"
msgstr "提供 `telink_apply_compiler_options()` 函数，将编译选项应用到目标"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:185
msgid ""
"Automatically applies preprocessor macro definitions (autoconf.h, "
"capabilities.h, pinmux.h)"
msgstr "自动应用预处理器宏定义（autoconf.h、capabilities.h、pinmux.h）"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:186
msgid ""
"Supports dynamically loading compilation options from JSON configuration "
