#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:376
msgid "2.2.7 extensions.cmake"
msgstr "2.2.7 extensions.cmake"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:378
msgid ""
"The `extensions.cmake` module provides essential CMake utility functions "
"that extend the core CMake functionality to support the UniSDK build "
"system with conditional logic, source file management, and data "
"processing capabilities."
msgstr "`extensions.cmake` 模块提供了必要的 CMake 工具函数，通过条件逻辑、源文件管理和数据处理能力扩展了核心 CMake 功能以支持 UniSDK 构建系统。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:380
msgid "**Key Functions and Features:**"
msgstr "**主要函数和特性：**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:382
msgid "**Conditional Variable Management**"
msgstr "**条件变量管理**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:383
msgid ""
"`set_ifndef(variable value [PARENT_SCOPE])`: Sets a variable to the "
"specified value only if it is not already defined. This function helps "
"establish default values while allowing them to be overridden. The "
"optional `PARENT_SCOPE` parameter makes the variable available in the "
"parent scope."
msgstr "`set_ifndef(variable value [PARENT_SCOPE])`：仅在变量未定义时将其设置为指定值。此函数有助于建立默认值，同时允许被覆盖。可选的 `PARENT_SCOPE` 参数使变量在父作用域中可用。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:385
msgid "**Conditional Source File Management**"
msgstr "**条件源文件管理**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:386
msgid ""
"`add_sources_ifdef(config src)`: Adds source files to the target only "
"when a specific configuration option is enabled. This enables feature-"
"specific code inclusion based on build configurations."
msgstr "`add_sources_ifdef(config src)`：仅在特定配置选项启用时将源文件添加到目标。这允许基于构建配置实现特定功能的代码包含。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:387
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`add_sources(src)`: A simplified wrapper for `target_sources()` that adds"
" source files to the current target (`${TARGET_NAME}`) without "
"conditions."
msgstr "`add_sources(src)`：`target_sources()` 的简化包装器，无条件地将源文件添加到当前目标（`${TARGET_NAME}`）。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:389
msgid "**JSON Array Processing**"
msgstr "**JSON 数组处理**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:390
msgid ""
"`json_to_list(JSON_ARRAY_STRING OUTPUT_LIST [OUTPUT_STRING])`: Converts a"
" JSON array string into a CMake list. This function performs type "
"validation to ensure the input is a valid JSON array, processes each "
"element, and handles space-separated values within elements. It can "
"output both a CMake list and an optional space-joined string "
"representation."
msgstr "`json_to_list(JSON_ARRAY_STRING OUTPUT_LIST [OUTPUT_STRING])`：将 JSON 数组字符串转换为 CMake 列表。此函数执行类型验证以确保输入是有效的 JSON 数组，处理每个元素，并处理元素内的空格分隔值。它可以输出 CMake 列表和可选的空格连接字符串表示。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:392
msgid "**Implementation Details**"
msgstr "**实现细节**"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:393
msgid "The module uses `include_guard(GLOBAL)` to prevent multiple inclusions"
msgstr "该模块使用 `include_guard(GLOBAL)` 防止多次包含"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:394
msgid "Functions are designed with parent scope propagation where appropriate"
msgstr "函数在适当的情况下设计了父作用域传播"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:395
msgid "Error handling is implemented for invalid JSON input"
msgstr "对无效的 JSON 输入实现了错误处理"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:397
msgid ""
"This module serves as a foundational component of the build system, "
"providing reusable functionality that simplifies conditional builds, "
"feature toggling, and data processing within CMake scripts."
msgstr "此模块作为构建系统的基础组件，提供可重用的功能，简化了 CMake 脚本中的条件构建、功能切换和数据处理。"

