#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:481
msgid ""
"**Current Implementation Status and Limitations:** While the application-"
"level CMakeLists.txt is designed as the entry point, there are currently "
"some limitations in the implementation due to tight coupling between demo"
" names, application layers, and the overall SDK Kconfig system:"
msgstr "**当前实现状态和限制：** 虽然应用级 CMakeLists.txt 被设计为入口，但由于演示名称、应用层和整体 SDK Kconfig 系统之间的紧密耦合，目前实现中存在一些限制："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:484
msgid ""
"**Kconfig System Coupling**: The demo applications' configuration options"
" are deeply integrated with the SDK's global Kconfig system, making it "
"challenging to completely isolate application-specific configurations."
msgstr "**Kconfig 系统耦合**：演示应用的配置选项与 SDK 的全局 Kconfig 系统深度集成，使得完全隔离应用特定配置变得具有挑战性。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:486
msgid ""
"**Demo Name Dependencies**: Some build system components rely on specific"
" demo naming conventions, which creates dependencies between application "
"names and internal SDK build logic."
msgstr "**演示名称依赖**：一些构建系统组件依赖于特定的演示命名约定，这在应用名称和内部 SDK 构建逻辑之间创建了依赖关系。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:488
msgid ""
"**Application Layer Integration**: The application layer's interaction "
"with core SDK components is not yet fully modularized, requiring careful "
"management of include paths and configuration settings."
msgstr "**应用层集成**：应用层与核心 SDK 组件的交互尚未完全模块化，需要仔细管理包含路径和配置设置。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:490
msgid ""
"These limitations are being addressed in ongoing development efforts to "
"create a more modular and flexible build system that fully realizes the "
"application-level entry point design."
msgstr "这些限制正在通过持续的开发工作来解决，以创建一个更加模块化和灵活的构建系统，充分实现应用级入口设计。"

