msgid ""
"The `Makefile` in the project root directory provides a traditional make "
"command interface as a frontend to CMake, offering a simplified workflow "
"for developers. It has been recently refactored to improve "
"maintainability and flexibility:"
msgstr "项目根目录中的 `Makefile` 提供传统的 make 命令接口作为 CMake 的前端，为开发者提供简化的工作流。它最近经过重构以提高可维护性和灵活性："

