msgstr "重构后的 Makefile 定义了以下关键组件："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1612
msgid ""
"**Phony Targets**: All targets (`cmake`, `config`, `pinmux`, `build`, "
"`clean`, `cleanbuild`) are marked as phony to avoid conflicts with actual"
" files"
msgstr "**伪目标**：所有目标（`cmake`、`config`、`pinmux`、`build`、`clean`、`cleanbuild`）都被标记为伪目标，以避免与实际文件冲突"

