msgid ""
"**Default Application**: Set default application to build (`gpio_demo`) "
"with override capability"
msgstr "**默认应用**：设置默认构建的应用（`gpio_demo`），支持覆盖"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1615
msgid ""
"**CMake Integration**: Uses CMake commands (`cmake -B`, `cmake --build`) "
"for all build operations"
msgstr "**CMake 集成**：使用 CMake 命令（`cmake -B`、`cmake --build`）进行所有构建操作"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1616
msgid ""
"**Pre-build Checks**: Implements automatic validation and recovery "
"mechanisms"
msgstr "**预构建检查**：实现自动验证和恢复机制"

