msgstr "UniSDK 构建系统明确将配置过程与构建过程分离："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1968
msgid "**Configuration Phase**: Generate configuration files through Kconfig"
msgstr "**配置阶段**：通过 Kconfig 生成配置文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1969
msgid ""
"**Generation Phase**: CMake uses configuration files to generate the "
"build system"
msgstr "**生成阶段**：CMake 使用配置文件生成构建系统"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1970
msgid "**Build Phase**: Ninja executes actual compilation and linking tasks"
msgstr "**构建阶段**：Ninja 执行实际的编译和链接任务"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1972
msgid "8.2 Modular Design"
msgstr "8.2 模块化设计"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1974
msgid ""
"The system adopts a highly modular design, with each module responsible "
"for specific functionality:"
msgstr "系统采用高度模块化设计，每个模块负责特定的功能："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1976
msgid "Modules interact through clear interfaces"
msgstr "模块通过清晰的接口进行交互"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1977
msgid "Configuration information is passed through variables and properties"
msgstr "配置信息通过变量和属性传递"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1978
msgid "Supports conditional loading and replacement of modules"
msgstr "支持条件加载和替换模块"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1980
msgid "8.3 Multiple Build Method Support"
msgstr "8.3 多种构建方式支持"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1982
msgid ""
"The system simultaneously supports multiple build methods to meet "
"different usage scenarios:"
msgstr "系统同时支持多种构建方式以满足不同使用场景："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1984
msgid "**West Commands**: Provide simplified command-line interfaces"
msgstr "**West 命令**：提供简化的命令行接口"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1985
msgid "**Direct CMake Calls**: Provide complete configuration control"
msgstr "**直接 CMake 调用**：提供完整的配置控制"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1986
msgid "**Make Commands**: Compatible with traditional build habits"
msgstr "**Make 命令**：兼容传统构建习惯"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1988
msgid "9. Extension and Customization"
msgstr "9. 扩展与定制"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1990
msgid "9.1 West Extension Commands Behavior"
msgstr "9.1 West 扩展命令行为"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1992
msgid "West Command Behavior in Different Directories"
msgstr "不同目录下的 West 命令行为"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1994
msgid ""
"The west tool's output varies depending on the current working directory "
"due to its extension command mechanism:"
msgstr "由于扩展命令机制，west 工具的输出因当前工作目录而异："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1996
msgid ""
"**Extension Command Discovery**: West searches for `.west/config` "
"configuration files in the current directory and its parent directories "
"to locate the workspace."
msgstr "**扩展命令发现**：West 在当前目录及其父目录中搜索 `.west/config` 配置文件以定位工作空间。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:1998
msgid ""
"**Project Manifest Loading**: When a workspace is found, west loads the "
"`west.yml` manifest file which defines project-specific extension "
"commands through the `west-commands` field."
msgstr "**项目清单加载**：找到工作空间后，west 加载 `west.yml` 清单文件，该文件通过 `west-commands` 字段定义项目特定的扩展命令。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2000
msgid "**Command Availability**:"
msgstr "**命令可用性**："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2001
msgid ""
"Inside a configured workspace, west loads unisdk project extensions and "
"displays custom commands like `tl-build`, `tl-boards`, and `tl-socs`"
msgstr "在已配置的工作空间内，west 加载 unisdk 项目扩展并显示自定义命令，如 `tl-build`、`tl-boards` 和 `tl-socs`"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2002
msgid ""
"Outside any workspace, west only shows built-in commands since no "
"project-specific extensions are available"
msgstr "在任何工作空间外，west 仅显示内置命令，因为没有项目特定的扩展可用"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2004
msgid ""
"**UniSDK Extension Commands**: The unisdk project defines three custom "
"extensions in `scripts/west-commands.yml`:"
msgstr "**UniSDK 扩展命令**：unisdk 项目在 `scripts/west-commands.yml` 中定义了三个自定义扩展："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2005
msgid "`tl-build`: Compile a Telink application"
msgstr "`tl-build`：编译 Telink 应用"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2006
msgid "`tl-boards`: Display information about supported Telink boards"
msgstr "`tl-boards`：显示支持的 Telink 板卡信息"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2007
msgid "`tl-socs`: Display information about supported Telink SOCs"
msgstr "`tl-socs`：显示支持的 Telink SOC 信息"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2009
msgid ""
"This behavior allows west to provide context-aware tooling based on the "
"current project workspace while maintaining consistency across different "
"development environments."
msgstr "这种行为使 west 能够基于当前项目工作空间提供上下文感知的工具，同时在不同开发环境之间保持一致性。"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2011
msgid "9.2 Adding New Build Modules"
msgstr "9.2 添加新的构建模块"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2013
msgid "To add a new build module:"
msgstr "要添加新的构建模块："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2015
msgid "Create a new `.cmake` file in the `cmake/modules/` directory"
msgstr "在 `cmake/modules/` 目录中创建一个新的 `.cmake` 文件"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2016
msgid "Add the module to the loading list in `telink_default.cmake`"
msgstr "将该模块添加到 `telink_default.cmake` 的加载列表中"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2017
msgid "Implement the module's configuration and functionality"
msgstr "实现模块的配置和功能"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2019
msgid "9.3 Extending West Commands"
msgstr "9.3 扩展 West 命令"

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2021
msgid "To add a new West command:"
msgstr "要添加新的 West 命令："

#: ../../source/build_config/build_system_architecture.md:2023
msgid ""
"Create a command implementation file in the `scripts/west_commands/` "
"directory"
msgstr "在 `scripts/west_commands/` 目录中创建命令实现文件"
